  "sections": [
    {
      "h2": "How to read the cards",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Network</strong>: the infrastructure the provider uses. Brands on the same network can offer the same top speed or coverage.</li><li><strong>Owner</strong>: helps you spot sister brands (for example, BT, EE and Plusnet are all BT Group).</li><li><strong>Official site</strong>: links go straight to the provider. Always check today’s price and availability for your address there.</li></ul><p>We don’t rank providers or publish star ratings. Prices, speeds and coverage vary by address and change often. Ownership and network details were checked in October 2026.</p>"
    }
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Why isn’t my provider listed?",
      "a": "There are hundreds of smaller broadband and mobile providers. We list the largest and most-searched ones first and add more over time."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do providers pay to appear here?",
      "a": "No. Some links may become affiliate links, which can earn us a commission, but that doesn’t decide who is listed or what we say."
    }
  ],
